"major-12|pentacles-03":"Slow down and let others weigh in. A friend's outside view on your relationship or your search may be useful, if you are willing to hear it. If you are single, let community bring warmth at its own pace. If you are partnered, try a shared project and see it from your partner's side.",
"major-12|pentacles-04":"You may be stuck between holding on and letting go. While things hang in suspension, look at the situation from the other side. What is your guard protecting, and what is it costing? If you are single, a willing pause can loosen an old rule. If you are partnered, listen without defending.",
