"major-13|wands-08":"An ending may be followed by quick developments. Give yourself time to feel before answering the rush. If you are single, a fast new interest may be a distraction from grief. If together, take a breath before big decisions.",
"major-13|wands-09":"You have been through a lot, and you are still here. Endings are tiring, and you are allowed to be slow. Let yourself grieve what is over without guarding against every new hurt. If you are single, healing is a reasonable thing to prioritize.",
