"cups-09|cups-12":"A wish is met with a romantic offer. If you are single, consider it from a position of contentment rather than need, and enjoy the courtship. If together, plan something special as a way to celebrate what you have. Charm lands best on a settled heart.",
"cups-09|cups-13":"Contentment and emotional depth stand together. If you are single, your inner steadiness is attractive and helps you recognize someone who matches it. If together, deep trust is what makes the comfort real. Appreciate the listener beside you, or become one.",
"cups-09|cups-14":"A comfortable heart and a fair mind create a solid partnership. If you are single, aim for stability and kindness, which you seem to have already. If together, enjoy the security and keep tending it with good communication. Wishes come true with steady care.",
"cups-10|cups-11":"A home full of belonging receives a tender message. If you are single, a kind note from a family friend or relative may lead to an introduction. If together, a small sentimental gesture can warm a household. Let the newest feeling be welcomed by everyone.",
